    REFACTOR-0002: give Customer sole ownership of its loyalty status

    The status rule was duplicated across Offering.register (both branches)
    and catalogue.ts's seeding loops. Customer now owns the invariant that
    relates interests to status: recordCategory() is the only way to add an
    interest, and status is derived from interests rather than stored.

